Samdech Techo Hun Sen: ASEAN-China must join hands to fight Kovid 19 to ensure sustainable socio-economic activities and survival
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, said that ASEAN and China must continue to work together to fight and overcome the disease 19 to ensure the sustainable socio-economic activities and survival of the people. .
This statement was made by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of the opening of the 18th China-ASEAN Expo 2021 under the theme "Sharing the opportunities gained from the new land and sea corridor to build the China-ASEAN Community. One for the future together "on September 10, 2021, giving a speech via online video from Phnom Penh.
On behalf of the Royal Government and the people of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen would like to express his deep gratitude to the Government and the people of China for their support to the Royal Government and the people of Cambodia through all kinds of technical assistance in the treatment of Kovid 19. Doctors and, in particular, help with the Kovid 19 vaccine, as well as assisting the Cambodian side in ordering vaccines from China.
At the same time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also commended the Chinese government and people for their active participation and leading role in the fight against Kovid 19 in the global framework through the production and distribution of vaccines, the provision of Assistance in medical equipment and sharing of experience in the prevention, care and treatment of Kovid 19 patients.
