The following is the decision of Banteay Meanchey Provincial Administration: The Minister of Commerce defended three important draft laws in the National Assembly
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, defended three draft laws that were discussed and approved by the National Assembly on September 9, 2021. The three draft laws are: the draft law on the ratification of the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement (AEC), the draft law on the ratification of the Cambodia-China Free Trade Agreement and the draft law. On competition.
The Second Committee reviewed the draft law on the approval of the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement (APEC) and the Ninth Committee of the National Assembly, in cooperation with the Fifth Commission, reviewed the draft law on Approve the Cambodia-China Free Trade Agreement and the draft law on competition.
Mr. Cheam Yeap and Ms. Nin Saphon emphasized that the request for approval of these three draft laws was in accordance with the provisions of the Constitution and the Rules of Procedure of the National Assembly.
The Minister highlighted the benefits and importance of the above three draft laws, and in particular the excellent and close cooperation with the relevant ministries and institutions in achieving these achievements, which are important mechanisms in Market diversification and promotion of economic, trade and investment linkages in both bilateral and regional frameworks.
The meeting commended the Ministry of Commerce and the Inter-Ministerial-Institutional Negotiation Working Group, led by the Minister of Commerce, for their efforts to develop trade laws and regulations aimed at improving the business environment and, in particular, its efforts. Successfully complete the above two FTA negotiations in accordance with the mandate provided by the Head of Government.
After a thorough review, the meeting fully approved the above three draft laws.
On behalf of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Mr. Pan Sosak expressed his deep gratitude to the whole meeting for approving the above three draft laws and sincerely hoped that these three laws would bring significant benefits to the whole society. And promote the economic growth of Cambodia, especially will play an important role in the Royal Government's efforts to restore the socio-economic situation in the Kovid-19 crisis.
