(Phnom Penh): Mr. Wang Yi, State Councilor and Minister of Foreign Affairs of the People's Republic of China will pay a two-day official visit to Cambodia on September 12-13, 2021 at the invitation of Deputy Prime Minister Prak. Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia.
A senior official of the Royal Government of Cambodia confirmed to Fresh News that during the official visit, the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Mr. Wang Yi will preside over the handover ceremony of the Techo Heritage National Stadium. China has provided construction assistance to Cambodia, which will take place on the evening of September 12, 2021.
Wang Yi's visit to Cambodia follows his visit to Vietnam, and after his visit to Cambodia, Wang Yi will continue his visits to Singapore and South Korea.
