Commentary: The China Services Trade Fair closes on the spot, but the online organization will continue to achieve remarkable achievements
BEIJING, Sept. 7 (Xinhua) - The six-day China International Services Trade Fair 2021, which lasted six days, closed in Beijing, China. According to preliminary statistics, as of 4:00 pm on the same day, the trade fair of services has achieved a proud result of 1672 copies, and this trade volume has increased compared to last year. Previously, it can be said that this exhibition has achieved remarkable and unexpected achievements.
By 2020, hit by an epidemic of Kovid 19, the global service trade volume has shrunk by a fifth, while digital services have grown contrary to the general trend and will become the new locomotive. Of future service business development. Thus, this year's Services Trade Fair grasped the key word: "Digital" and organized the first special exhibition on digital services to pioneer a new impetus for development.
