Comment: The US side only uses rational and sensible eyes on Sino-US relations
In the past, because the US side has implemented some serious wrong policies that interfere with China's internal affairs and destroy the interests of the Chinese side, so the relationship between China and the United States has encountered serious difficulties. In this context, John Forbes Kerry paid two visits to China in the first half of the year, which was considered by outsiders as a difficult point in Sino-US relations.
Although Sino-US relations have reached a difficult stage, tackling climate change is hoped to become an important area of cooperation between the two sides. Cooperation between China and the United States on climate change should be based on the "Paris Agreement", China respects the development and free will of nations, and China's development and free will need to be respected.
But such cooperation needs to be mutually beneficial. The US side must not destroy the interests of the Chinese side, expect the Chinese side to cooperate unconditionally. The US side can only remove obstacles to cooperation between China and the United States by using sincerity and common sense on Sino-US relations.
