On September 05, 2021, 5 grandparents who received a donation from Samdech Techo Prime Minister in the amount of 3 million Riels and many other food items, including:
By September 6, 2021, 5 more grandparents were handed over by Mrs. O Vandin, including:
On that occasion, Ms. O Vandin always brought greetings from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia to the grandparents, as well as asked about their health status after vaccination against Kovid 19. He also asked why they were encouraged to get vaccinated.
The vaccinated grandmother and grandfather thanked Samdech Techo Prime Minister for allowing him to be vaccinated and given him a gift on this occasion. They also sent their condolences and sympathy to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, through Mrs. O Vandin.
Their grandparents expressed the view that the Kovid 19 vaccine was very important to them, even though they were old, but that the vaccine could protect them from Kovid 19. They are not infected with anything that causes him serious illness.
According to Ms. O Vandin's inquiries, the grandparents' family also confirmed that the grandparents were all willing to get vaccinated on their own, without any coercion from their children.
