Dr. Le Chansangvat continued, "Now the provincial administration has decided to appoint Dr. Chakraborty as the full-fledged chairman, without going through the acting chairman or deputy chairman."
Please be reminded that the incident that led to the removal of Dr. Chan Vithy Navuth from the director of the Cambodia-Japan Friendship Hospital in Mongkol Borei happened after Mr. Ou Rathrey, the Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province, donated blood to save a lieutenant colonel who was Samdech's bodyguard. Techo, who had severe appendicitis and had to undergo surgery because of a blood clot in a bloodless hospital.
