* Fifth: Permission to pay taxes and import duties on existing right-hand drive vehicles locally for the last time, but to change the steering wheel from right to left to legalize Cambodia's road traffic. The permit expires by the end of June 2022. After that, the right-hand drive vehicle that is suppressed will be required to be disassembled or destroyed.
