Honorary General Hing Bun Heang, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Deputy Chief of Staff of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's Cabinet, came to Battambang province to buy fragrant lentils for nearly 20 days. The gourds collected were also handed over to government officials at ministries, institutions in the provinces, as well as the people's medical team, who are working to cure and treat 19 Kovid.
