After receiving this request, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also instructed Duke Leng Navatra, Samdech's representative, to come down and collect the remaining fragrant lentils.
Please note that this collection of longan fruit is bought only from the people who own the plantation with poor living conditions. On the other hand, the owners of affluent plantations are not harvested, and on the other hand, the lentils of those who have large plantations are not yet harvested.
The intervention of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit in buying lentils from the people now helps to share the losses of the people and help solve their problems as well. The intervention of Samdech Techo Prime Minister and Samdech Kittipritthbandit also showed Samdech Techo's high attention and consideration for all people when facing difficulties.
