Xi Jinping said that China will enhance the level of openness, promote the implementation of cross-border trade lists across the country, and seek to build a national model area for innovation and service trade development. China will increase support for the joint development of the country's "belt and road" service industry to share China's technological development achievements.
It should be noted that the China International Services Trade Fair has been held seven times since 2012. The China International Services Trade Fair is the largest diversified trade fair in the global trade in services and also a trading platform.
In a video speech in September 2020, Xi Jinping outlined three initiatives on openness and cooperation in the service industry and announced that Beijing would establish a national multi-role model for expansion. Openness of the service industry and free trade pilot areas with important features such as scientific and technological innovation, openness of the service industry and digital economy.
