Three women gathered to eat alcohol in a rented room in Chamkarmon district, causing poisoning, two died in a rented room, another died in his hometown
(Phnom Penh): Three young women gathered to eat mixed food in a rented room, causing poisoning and death of the three of them, causing a surprise on the afternoon of September 2, 2021, at the point of renting house No. 27, Group 44 Village 8 in Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkar Mon, Phnom Penh, two died in a rented room and one died on arrival in his hometown in Lvea Em district, Kandal province.
According to sources from the victim's aunt, at around 9 am on September 2, the victim's friend called her to say that her niece had died of alcohol poisoning. Immediately after receiving this news, the aunt traveled from Prey Veng province to the scene.
When he arrived at the rented room, he saw one of his nieces lying dead on the mattress with his friend, and to the great surprise of the people living near the scene, he reported to the administrative police station. Check.
Local police reported to the Khan and forensic forces of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police for inspection. In fact, when the forensic experts came down, they waited for the doctors to test for Kovid before examining the bodies of the two victims.
An autopsy confirmed that the two women had been poisoned to death. After the examination, the body was handed over to the family for a traditional ceremony.
At the same time, it was reported that the other two female friends, who were drinking together in the rented room, also died on arrival at their hometown in Lvea Em district, province. Kandal.
