Mohammad Abbas Stanik Zay is a deputy minister of the former Taliban government and has lived in Doha, Qatar for decades. Stanick Jai became head of the Taliban's political bureau in 2015 and has represented the Taliban on diplomatic visits to several countries.
Abdul Hakim Haqqani is the Taliban's chief negotiator and chair of the influential Council of Religious Affairs. Hakim Hakkani is believed to be one of Akun Zada's most trusted people. Cambodian Embassy Intervenes to Return 14 Cambodian Workers and One Child to Thailand
