Phnom Penh Military Arrests a Man Who Claims to Be a Military Officer and Threatens to Extort Money from Meanchey Residents
(Phnom Penh): A man was arrested by the Phnom Penh Municipal Armed Forces and the Meanchey District Military Police Base and sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court after extorting money from people and accusing them of selling drugs.
The incident took place on August 26, 2021, when a group of criminals knocked on the door of a couple's rented room in the middle of the night, accusing them of selling drugs and extorting money from citizens. Damnak Thom 3 Village, Sangkat Steung Meanchey III, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh.
Later, because the victim had no money, the suspect forced the couple to take their motorcycle as collateral at the ammunition depot for $ 500 and return the collateral to the victim before removing her husband's handcuffs in the morning. One of the five security guards came to take another $ 100 bail from the victim.
Immediately after receiving the above information, Lt. Gen. Rath Sreang, Deputy Commander of the National Gendarmerie and Commander of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie, immediately sent a professional officer to search until they found that the criminals were not It has nothing to do with any of the military and is determined to catch the criminals who claim to be the military.
Through the strict measures of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie, together with the Meanchey District Gendarmerie, the families of the suspects heard that they could not escape and brought the suspects to confess before the Gendarmerie. Meanchey on the afternoon of August 30, 2021.
The suspect, who is claimed to be a military man named Rothara, 30 years old, real occupation as a car driver, currently resides at No. 957, Chrey Kong Village, Sangkat Choam Chao 2, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh. After receiving the joint confession, the Meanchey District Gendarmerie sent the suspect to the Phnom Penh Criminal Police Office for further investigation.
Until the morning of September 2, 2021, professional officers of the Criminal Office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie have built a case and sent the suspect to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court for sentencing according to legal procedures, while other parties, the competent authorities are looking to arrest It continues.
