BEIJING: Even if the US military withdraws from Afghanistan, the killing of civilians by the US military and its allies in Afghanistan during the 20-year war must take place, a Chinese Foreign Ministry spokesman said Wednesday. Investigate thoroughly. This is according to the release by the Xinhua news agency on Wednesday night, September 1, 2021.
Spokesman Wang Wenbin made the remarks at a daily news conference in response to questions about the recent killing of civilians by US troops during the withdrawal from Afghanistan.
