Kampong Thom Provincial Administration Decides to End Administrative Measures from September 3
(Kampong Thom): The Kampong Chhnang Provincial Administration has issued a decision to end administrative measures that temporarily suspend work activities, businesses and businesses at high risk of spreading Kovid 19 and private gatherings or gatherings to prevent the spread of the disease. Kovid 19 disease in Kampong Thom province from September 3, 2021 onwards.
