Opposition in this way cannot make one live in the world one wants to live in, for the better, for the better and for the constructive, for democracy, for human rights, for the development of harmony. This kind of opposition is called "opposition only for opposition." Mr. Chao Phirun: Party members must always have a strong position to develop and lead to victory in the 2022 Commune / Sangkat Election
