Mr. Chao Phirun stated that in order to achieve the development of local infrastructure, the members of the party must have a strong position, not too hard, not too soft, not too soft, in line with the party's principles, and we must remain Get closer to the people to know their lives and the shortcomings as well as the desire to develop the village-commune to be beautiful.
Mr. Chao Phirun said that all party members need to know that the local people are growing every day in the villages and communes, so the same development, we need to accelerate development, increase human resources and find partners to cooperate in development. In accordance with the policy of the Royal Government to campaign for the upcoming 5th Mandate Commune Election 2022.
He added that if the commune village has no infrastructure, no development and our officials do not go directly to the people, the people have lost faith in this authority. Therefore, all party members must work with the people to increase infrastructure, development, increase human resources, find partners for investment development projects, and boost the economic sector to increase employment in order to improve people's lives.
Mr. Ith Sam Heng Yang made this statement during a meeting to announce the composition of the working group to build a national information group on asbestos in Cambodia, organized in collaboration with the ILO / Japan through the project to improve health standards and Occupational safety in the field of construction and APHEDA through the Zoom video system on the morning of August 31, 2021.
Mr. Ith Sam Heng stated that in the industrial sector, the use of raw materials resources is always twofold, that is, can create a product or make the product more quality for use and more effective, but on the other hand, if it is not careful. In return, not only the workers who are the producers, but also the consumers and those around them can be at risk.
He added that asbestos is commonly used on fibrous cement roofing, and if ordinary tiles are made without asbestos, the tiles and fibrous will break down under high pressure. Therefore, manufacturers prefer to use it to ensure quality and competition in the market.
