This kind of instruction of the provincial governor was made on the occasion that he had a meeting to visit and bring food gifts to distribute to 65 families who are trapped in the temporary blocking area in Peng market. Khun in Sen Monorom, with 19 Kovid positive people, involved in the February 20 community event.
At the same time, Mr. Svay Sam Eang sent a message from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, who always thinks about the well-being of the general population, especially the people who are stuck at the temporary blockade of positive Kovid people. 19 Involved in the February 20 community event.
"Throughout the districts in Mondulkiri province, we are spreading 19 cases of Kovid to the community, up to hundreds of positive people, and some areas have been temporarily closed and these problems are causing," he said. "Due to the lack of participation of the people in complying with the measures of the Ministry of Health, especially the measures of the Royal Government."
In addition, the provincial governor also called on all people who have a history of direct or indirect contact with people with positive Kovid 19 or any other suspected symptoms, please hurry to the hospital or health center. Near where you live or report to local authorities. Noodle National Company Donates Equipment to Kovid 19 Sample Center of National Blood Transfusion Center
(Phnom Penh): Mi Cheat has fully supported the installation of various equipment in the Kovid 19 Sample Center of the National Blood Transfusion Center to contribute to the Royal Government and the Ministry of Health in supporting operations to combat the spread of Kovid 19 disease through rapid sampling to cut off the global transmission of Kovid 19 disease.
The handing over ceremony of the Kovid-19 Sample Center of the National Blood Transfusion Center took place on the morning of August 30, 2021, with the participation of Mrs. Neak Oknha Chheng Sokuntheavy, General Director of OneFreternity (MI Cheat) and Mr. Dr. Sok Po, President of the National Blood Transfusion Center.
