Ms. Neang Oknha Chheng Sokuntheavy The installation of equipment in the Kovid-19 Sample Center of the National Blood Transfusion Center was done to support the provision of sampling services to the people quickly, safely and comfortably.
She said the support was organized under the "Khmer for Khmer" project, a program designed to support activities in response to the immediate response to the spread of the Kovid 19 virus.
Dr. Sok Po considered that the donation of equipment in the Kovid 19 Sample Center of the National Blood Transfusion Center today is a noble gesture of the National Blood Transfusion Company in responding to the urgent needs and necessities of the center. Attention to social participation, especially in support of the Royal Government's strategy to prevent the spread of Kovid 19.
