"Cambodian Social Protection Promotion Mechanism" Project Officially Launched
(Phnom Penh): The project "Cambodian Social Protection Promotion Mechanism" was officially launched on August 30, 2021 with the participation of Dr. John Narith, Under Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance and Secretary General of the Council. National Social Protection.
The "Social Protection Dissemination Mechanism" project was developed in collaboration with the General Secretariat of the National Council for Social Protection and Oxfam in Cambodia and funded by the German Agency for International Development (GIZ).
This social protection outreach mechanism is an important part of the implementation of the overall social protection communication and outreach strategy. This strategy aims to promote outreach for three goals, including:
