A senior official of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs said that out of the nine people, eight will arrive at Phnom Penh International Airport by Singapore Airlines Flight SQ158 on August 29, 2021 at 05:30 pm. Another worker will arrive at Phnom Penh International Airport on Singapore Airlines Flight SQ158 on August 30, 2021 at 05:30 PM.
