Chinese Deputy Foreign Minister: "US report on traces of the origin of Kovid 19 virus" lacks scientific expertise and credibility
BEIJING, Aug. 28 (Xinhua) - Chinese Vice Foreign Minister Ma Zhaoxu gave an interview to reporters at the General Administration of Radio and Television of the People's Republic of China (PRC) on Tuesday. US intelligence released.
Ma Zhaoxu said US intelligence had recently fabricated a so-called report on the origin of the 19 Kovid virus. This report has no scientific expertise and is not credible at all. China has repeatedly said that tracing the origin of the 19 Kovid virus should be carried out by scientists around the world.
But the United States has ordered intelligence agencies to do the work, as evidence that the United States considers tracking the origin of the virus a political issue. China attaches great importance to and actively participates in cooperation in the field of global detection of 19 cases of Kovid virus and invites WHO experts to China twice for research Trace the origin.
America has a duty and an obligation to provide answers to the world. China reiterates US policy that politicization, traceability of Kovid 19 virus is no way out, US should stop undermining global unity in fighting Kovid 19 Again, trace the origin of the 19 Kovid virus according to scientific expertise and cooperate to fight infectious diseases.
