A senior official of the Ministry of Environment stressed: "Our officers are exposed to risks, difficult situations and accidents, especially the perpetrators can cause harm when our officials enforce the law." "Apart from this, they also face other factors such as illness, overcoming many difficult obstacles while performing work, such as floods, dangerous animals, etc."
