(Ratanakkiri): There was an incident that shocked the people and the authorities after a pregnant woman gave birth on National Road 78 while her husband was driving a motorbike to the health center at the border. Trapeang Chreis Commune and Trapeang Krahorm Commune, Kon Mom District, Rattanakiri Province at 4:30 am on August 27, 2021.
Heng Srey Neath, 23 years old, lives in Village 3, Trapeang Krahorm Commune, Kon Mom District, Ratanakkiri Province. On the day of the incident, the wife told her husband that she had a stomach ache, and the husband rushed her to the Kon Mom District Health Center. Halfway to the border between Trapeang Chreis and Trapeang Krahorm communes, a pregnant woman gave birth on the street without reaching the Kon Mom district health center.
At that time, some villagers also ran to save the baby girl. During this incident, the commune and district authorities immediately received the information and ordered the health center to lead the doctor to intervene to save. When the ambulance arrived, they helped to lift the car to the Kon Mom District Health Center immediately and the mother and baby were not in any danger.
On that occasion, the people also thanked the commune / district authorities and doctors who took care to seek the intervention of ambulances transporting pregnant women to health centers and save lives in time.
