MADRID: Recently, a well-known Spanish newspaper, Rebelion, published an article saying that 20 years after the invasion of Afghanistan, the United States and its allies were finally fleeing. This country, in a hurry, reflects great military, economic and political failures. This was released by the Xinhua News Agency on Thursday afternoon, August 26, 2021.
The article described the tumultuous withdrawal of troops from Afghanistan as a new scenario similar to the Vietnam War's Saigon for the United States and a shameful defeat for the superpower.
The military failure is that thousands of US troops have been killed in bombings and battlefields, and thousands more have returned home with serious injuries or severe mental illness. In addition, the economic cost of the war in Afghanistan was also a huge loss, with Washington spending more than $ 1.5 trillion.
The failure of the United States is also reflected in politics. By withdrawing troops, the United States recognizes the failure to fulfill its geopolitical ambitions in the region and will try to achieve its goals by other means, leaving the vast region destabilized.
