The Accounting and Auditing Regulator, in collaboration with the General Department of Taxation, disseminates the accounting and auditing obligations and updates of the tax law.
(Phnom Penh): The Accounting and Auditing Regulator of the Non-Banking Financial Services Authority, in collaboration with the General Department of Taxation of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, on August 25, 2021, organized a seminar on "Accounting and Auditing Obligations" and " Update on tax law ”for online enterprises.
The workshop was chaired by Mr. Bou Tharin, Director General of Accounting and Auditing, and was attended by the management and officials of the Accounting and Auditing Regulator, and Mr. Mabora, a representative of the General Department of Taxation, and about 850 participants.
Mr. Bou Tharin highlighted the importance and importance of the workshop for the enterprise and highlighted the obligations that the enterprise must comply with in accordance with the laws and regulations in force in the field of accounting and auditing and in accordance with the laws and regulations.
He stressed that the enterprise has to perform three essential obligations: 1: keeping the accounting records, 2: preparing the financial statements in accordance with the applicable standards, and 3: submitting the financial statements for independent audit in accordance with the law. .
He also emphasized that enterprises of all types, all sizes and all sectors of business, as well as non-profit organizations have an obligation to maintain proper accounting records and to prepare financial statements in accordance with the accounting standards set by the Ministry. Economics and Finance.
All enterprises that perform these obligations properly will benefit greatly, including transparency in the management of financial resources, ease of access to credit from banks or financial institutions, and increased capital through the market. Capital, finding foreign investment partners and avoiding penalties from the competent authorities, etc.
The Director General also instructed the members of the workshop to pay attention to the speakers and take the new wisdom to operate in business in accordance with the laws and regulations in force.
