The Ministry of Economy will officially launch the second phase of information technology business registration system on September 1.
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Economy and Finance on August 25, 2021 issued a press release on the official launch of the second phase of information technology business registration system on September 1, 2018. 2021.
A press release obtained by Fresh News today states that the ceremony was presided over by Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Economy and Finance and Chairman of the Economic and Financial Policy Committee.
There is also the participation of ministries and institutions involved in the registration of businesses in the information technology nursery, phase 1 and phase 2, representatives of associations, civil society organizations, development partners, embassies and educational institutions.
It should be noted that the information technology business registration system is a sharp reform package of the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, presented at the 18th Royal Government-Private Sector Forum on March 29. 2019 ago.
In the first phase, the system covered the business registration of the Ministry of Commerce, the tax registration of the General Department of Taxation and the issuance of the opening announcement of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training and was officially launched. June 15, 2020.
In particular, in the second phase, the system will expand the scope to apply for licenses or permits online according to business activities from ministries - professional institutions with the role of technical supervision in the field.
Four ministries and institutions participated in the second phase, including the Ministry of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation, the Ministry of Tourism, the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications, and the real estate and mortgage regulators of the Non-Banking Financial Services Authority. Minister of Mines and Energy receives 80,000 boxes of traditional Chinese medicine from 7 companies to distribute to people
