Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia and Jet Trust Royal Bank launch a fundraising campaign to support Kantha Bopha Hospital!
Kantha Bopha Hospital treats most children in Cambodia. All consultations and treatments are free, and over the past 30 years, Kantha Bopha Hospital has significantly reduced maternal and child mortality and saved the lives of millions of children in Cambodia.
The operating costs of Kantha Bopha Hospital are particularly high during the global epidemic of Kovid-19.
Jettrust Royal Bank, in collaboration with the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia, is launching a fundraising campaign called "A Cup of HOPE" to call on the public to donate to the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia in order to provide financial support to Kantha Bopha Hospital.
Many small donations from philanthropists are a great gift to help save the lives of children, especially by accessing free and non-discriminatory quality health services.
The cost of a glass of drink that you donate today can save the lives and future of many children in Cambodia.
