General Knowledge: World Autonomous Region (End)
Please be informed that Autonomous Region is defined as a region of a country with limited autonomy over certain privileges. Autonomous regions can be defined by geographical, economic or demographic factors.
In the legal sense, the division into autonomous regions is the division of sub-national administrations or internal territories of sovereign states that have a degree of autonomy and self-government, but remain under the control of the national administration.
