1. The right of the Board of Trustees or the donor of the Board of Governors to organize, manage and transfer their assets in a public order to the beneficiary for the purpose for which they want to be properly managed and administered by the licensed Board of Trustees. Recognize the regulatory authority of the Ministry of Public Works (NCT) for the benefit of the beneficiaries.
