Mr. Sok Siphana's remarks at a special panel discussion on "Guide to Business Recovery in the Context of Kovid 19 from a Private Perspective" organized by the Young Entrepreneurs Association recently.
Dr. says that the new investment law, which will come into force in the next three months, is a good investment law that creates a lot of convenience and comfort for both local and foreign investors.
Regarding the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement (APEC-RCEP), Mr. Sok Siphana stated that it would provide more opportunities for Cambodian entrepreneurs if they understood this agreement, which could create a cooperative partnership. With many of the 15 member countries of ASP-RCEP.
The RCEP was launched in November 2012 in Phnom Penh as Cambodia hosts the ASEAN Summit. The agreement aims to boost trade between ASEAN member states and Asia-Pacific partners.
