Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the Opening Ceremony of the Interfaith Ceremony Against Human Trafficking and the Global Epidemic of Kovid 19 (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on Friday afternoon, August 20, 2021. Opening Remarks at Interfaith Ceremony Against Human Trafficking and Epidemic Global 19 The ceremony was held to pray religiously and to work together to eliminate all forms of human trafficking.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expresses his congratulations and appreciation for the spirit of unity and harmony of all nations and religions in the Kingdom of Cambodia, especially the spirit of supporting the Royal Government of Cambodia in all circumstances as well as the world for the well-being of Humanity.
* Samdech Techo stated that since 2017, every year, the Kingdom of Cambodia celebrates interfaith celebrations against human trafficking, and the Royal Government and relevant institutions, including the private sector, often gather to perform religious prayers and commit to joint ventures. Eliminate human trafficking in all its forms.
* Samdech Techo, Head of the Royal Government, stated that the interfaith forum must be organized in a new way to remind the people of all nationalities and religions in the Kingdom of Cambodia as well as the people of the world to change and adapt. A new path in the Kovid period with the adherence to the spirit of humanity, compassion, care for the life and dignity of all human beings of all races and religions.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that Samdech is proud to maintain the harmony of all religious beliefs in the Kingdom of Cambodia through active cooperation, especially the consistent implementation of a culture of sharing with the dry. High sense of responsibility in this difficult seal.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the leaders of civil servants at all levels have been overcoming all obstacles to solve major problems in society, especially the prevention of all forms of global pandemics and have achieved remarkable results. Continue for our nation and our people to return to normalcy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has been actively implementing, on the one hand, to maintain security, order and social stability in order to sustain people's livelihoods and maintain macroeconomic stability, and on the other hand to fight the global Kovid 19 pandemic. Pictures of prevention, treatment and rehabilitation of victims and affected communities.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that after the vaccination of the people is close to achieving the final plan, the Royal Government is committed to achieving the goal of vaccinating children, young people aged 12 and under 18 before the end. 2021 to create immunity, reduce transmission into the community, restore our people to normal life to restore the family economy and society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his gratitude for the spirit of solidarity and mutual assistance in difficult times of friendly countries that provided timely vaccinations, especially the People's Republic of China, which is a leading country in providing vaccines and humanitarian assistance. Orders, as well as Japan, the United Kingdom, the United States, make the vaccination program run faster than planned.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also thanked the National Committee for Combating Human Trafficking, Religious Leaders, Cambodian and International Poetry, and partner organizations for supporting the National Interfaith Forum on Human Trafficking and the Kovid 19 Global Epidemic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on his compatriots to continue to maintain and implement the principles of prevention and health rules "3 protect and 3 do not" to be negligent and to get vaccinated against Kovid 19 provided by the Royal Government. Free for everyone to build immunity from this deadly pandemic.
