Commentary: The political rift without the US Red Line has become a black hand in blocking solidarity in the fight against global Kovid 19
BEIJING: You have every reason to believe that the United States has a cure for Kovid 19, otherwise why the former US president, an elderly patient, could be cured and discharged so quickly. ? What you can not believe is that of the more than 36 million cases of 19 cases of measles in the United States, more than 600,000 have died.
In the context of the epidemic, Americans have a very different fate, this is the consequence of a serious political rift in the United States. In the face of the spread of Kovid 19, American politicians often resorted to extremes from the political point of view: not only did they put up anti-virus political labels, but they also attacked each other. On measures to prevent and combat Kovid 19.
The fight against Kovid 19 is the most urgent task of the world today, and solidarity and cooperation are the strongest weapons. But the serious political rift without the US Red Line has become a black hand in blocking solidarity in the fight against global Kovid 19, which is destroying the interests of both countries and themselves.
