(Phnom Penh): Dr. Phan Phalla, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance and Chairman of the Board of the Small and Medium Enterprise Bank of Cambodia (BCME), confirmed that the Small and Medium Enterprise Bank of Cambodia is Learn how to get a mortgage loan that will be available soon.
