Please note that this is the second time that Major General Heng Lalin has donated to the above victims, which he and his wife have already helped once. This time, he was even more sympathetic when he learned that the unfortunate woman was working hard even though her wounds had not yet healed, so he and his wife gave a second gift to help. Relieve his misery for a while.
