Due to the shortage and hardship, he left the hospital without recovering and went to stay at his relatives' house in Kampong Cham province for a while and then asked for a house to stay for a while before coming to stay in a rented house as a security guard for the second time.
He said he received a salary of $ 187, but paid $ 50 for rent, not including food, water and electricity, with little left to pay for his injuries. The husband of the assailant was arrested by the police force of Po Sen Chey district at 5:30 pm on June 5, 2021 in Village 2, Kampong Treas Commune, Krouch Chhmar District, Tbong Khmum Province.
