General knowledge: Where did the resources used to build the ancient Egyptian pyramids come from?
(Phnom Penh): Egypt is rich in pyramid temples built for the burial of Pharaohs or their kings, while the policy of building those temples has been practiced for thousands of years. Do you know where the resources used to build the pyramid come from?
In ancient times, Egyptian kings or pharaohs, as well as Egyptian officials and people, participated in the construction of many pyramids throughout their empire. The resources and funds used for the construction of the pyramids came from the people who worshiped the deity, and partly from the personal property of the king, officials, especially the resources of the entire government (state budget).
