International commentary: "Some Western politicians should emulate the Olympic spirit"
BEIJING, Aug. 8 (Xinhua) - The Tokyo Olympics, which have been postponed for a year due to the Kovid-19 epidemic, ended smoothly on the night of August 8, despite Tokyo as well as the rest of the world. Will the high pressure caused by the new wave of infectious diseases.
Within half a month of the competition, people all over the world saw exciting world-class competencies, abilities and techniques.
In this competition, most of the athletes adhered to the spirit of the Olympics, which competes fairly. Usually the competition is to test their abilities, losing or winning is normal, winners are not proud, losers are not discouraged, the most important thing is to get good experience to improve their abilities gradually. This is the nation as a real athlete.
But we look back at some Western politicians who are "dare not lose", that is, in their minds, there is no fair competition, if they see their opponents ahead, they will use all kinds of tricks. Such as unreasonable accusations, slander, propaganda, pressure and intimidation. In the past, the actions of some Western politicians have hindered the development of other countries in the region and around the world.
Interference in internal affairs under the pretext of human rights, politics, nationalization, other issues, sanctions, etc. Has become one of their most frequently used tricks, causing chaos, causing endless chaos. The people of the world are not blind or ignorant, can clearly distinguish between black and white, right and wrong.
As we all know, in a sport, any player who breaks or violates the rules will be fined or expelled. After all, any country that has a hypocritical mind, does not respect the principles of relations between countries and the international code, slanders others, destabilizes the region, harms the common interests of mankind, will be excluded from the world arena. Missed.
