Mr. Phal Vandy said that in the context of Kovid 19, the Microfinance Association and its members have been actively involved in the reorganization of loans to more than 300,000 customers and a budget of about 1, $ 600 million, a huge solution to the difficult situation of customers.
He said that after the events of February 20 spread, the MFI and its members have implemented the three highest understanding measures, including: 1: No fines for late payment of customers, 2: Favor non-payment of interest from customers and third: Prepare credit with flexibility of customer repayment.
The microfinance sector has indeed implemented a consensus of partnering with clients who help each other in difficult times, and this work has done a lot with the special support of the National Bank of Cambodia and the Royal Government of Cambodia. .
According to Mr. Phal Vandy, in the past, when Cambodia faced natural disasters, microfinance has always been actively involved in helping people in both social work and understanding of responsible repayments. Partnership with fellow citizens.
He said that in the context of Kovid 19, the association and its members have also actively participated in government measures, and the health rules of the association and its members have also contributed funds to prevent the spread of Kovid 19, including the purchase of vaccines. To the people as well.
Mr. Phal Vandy added that in the economic recovery rules, the association has worked with the Ministry of Economy and Finance and the National Bank of Cambodia to develop a strategy to support the establishment of SME Bank, a bank to provide loans with a rate. The lowest money ever for small and medium businesses to revive the economy.
In addition, the Cambodian Microfinance Association has partnered with the Ministry of Economy and Finance to set up a credit guarantee corporation to support small and medium-sized businesses so that clients can access risk-aided loans.
To date, there are more than 2 million financial services users, about 60% of the total customers (banks and microfinance) in the amount of about 7 billion dollars that are benefiting. Both loans and deposits from microfinance institutions in Cambodia. General knowledge: Where is anesthesia first used?
(Phnom Penh): When doctors inject anesthetics into the body, the patient loses pain, which facilitates surgery as well as various treatments. Do you know where anesthetics were first used?
For hundreds of years, doctors have tried to relieve pain during surgery, prescribing alcohol, opium, and other drugs, but there is still no cure. Caught.
Dr. Long first used ether oil in 1942, injecting it with a towel and letting the patient sniff it to operate on a tumor on one patient's neck. Let the patient faint immediately. He has been using this method for years.
Later, Dr. Croft Long also mixed ethereal oil into an anesthetic for intravenous infusion before surgery and during childbirth.
Although he continued to use this type of anesthetic, he did not immediately release the findings. The results of these uses were finally published in 1849 in the Southern American Journal of Medicine and Surgery.
The anesthetic is also brought to Europe to assist in surgery and medical applications, as well as to prevent cancer on surgical wounds.
